                "model": "gemini-2.5-flash",
                "textPrompt": "You are the AI internship task coordinator. The company requirement document is the source of truth.\n\nIntern record:\n{{`1`}}\n\nRequirement document text:\n{{2.data}}\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON with these fields:\n{\n  \"action\": \"ONBOARDING\" or \"REVIEW\",\n  \"assignedTask\": \"\",\n  \"taskDescription\": \"\",\n  \"deadlineDays\": 2,\n  \"reviewDateOffsetDays\": 2,\n  \"emailSubject\": \"\",\n  \"emailBody\": \"\",\n  \"explanationAgenda\": \"\",\n  \"reason\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- Choose ONBOARDING when the intern has no assigned task or has not received the initial task email.\n- Choose REVIEW when an assigned task exists and the row indicates a review is due.\n- Do not claim that live Google Meet voice participation exists.\n- Keep the language professional, friendly, and suitable for an AI assistant that clearly identifies itself as AI.\n- Do not mark a task complete based only on file existence; completion requires evidence-based review."
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 600,
                    "y": 0,
                    "name": "Coordinate Lifecycle"
                },
                "restore": {
                    "expect": {
                        "model": {
                            "mode": "chose",
                            "label": "Gemini 2.5 Flash"
                        }
                    }
